source_zh:
"居然想偷看正在沐浴的淑女，快滚出去！";
"你知道这里是什么地方吗？竟敢闯进来！";
"去吧，我可爱的孩子们，把那些家伙引向永恒的黑暗。";
"再等等，我的魔力快要恢复了……";
"我忠诚的孩子们，去收集血液，把浴桶填满吧。";
"向我展现你们的忠诚吧。";
"啧啧啧，是该说你鲁莽呢，还是愚蠢呢……";
"呵呵？你还在挣扎着想活下去啊。";
"再努力一点吧，这才刚刚开始，你就喘成这样了？";
"你会明白，我从布里科拉卡斯那里学到的可不仅仅是魔法。"

translation:
"You actually want to peek at the lady taking a bath, get out of here!";
"Do you know where this place is? How dare you break in!";
"Go, my lovely children, and lead those guys into eternal darkness.";
"Wait a minute, my magic power is about to be restored...";
"My loyal children, collect blood and fill the tub.";
"Show me your loyalty.";
"Tsk tsk tsk, should I call you reckless or stupid...";
"Haha? You are still struggling to survive.";
"Try harder. This has just begun and you are already breathing like this?";
"You will see that I learned more than just magic from Bricolakas."

source_zh:
"血液中流淌的不朽力量终有一天会引导你们走向死亡。";
"你听到了吗？那是我属下的哀嚎声……家族的诅咒将永远伴随在阴影中。";
"这次我会退下，但终有一天，必将用你的肉制成肥皂，将血装满浴缸。"

translation:
"The immortal power flowing in your blood will one day lead you to death.";
"Did you hear it? That was the wailing sound of my subordinates... The curse of the family will always be in the shadows.";
"I will stand down this time, but one day I will make soap from your flesh and fill the bathtub with your blood."

source_zh:
"是谁派你们来的？你们这些家伙也是特佩兹的走狗吗？可恶的家伙……总有一天我要亲手……";
"那些失去吸血鬼自尊的愚蠢家伙，家族的诅咒将永远与你们形影不离。";
"你们血液中流淌的生命是谁给予的？这些不懂感恩的愚蠢家伙……"

translation:
"Who sent you here? Are you guys also Tepez's lackeys? Damn you guys... One day I will do it myself...";
"Those stupid guys who have lost their vampire self-respect, the family curse will always be with you.";
"Who gave you the life flowing in your blood? These stupid ungrateful guys..."

source_zh:
"愚蠢的家伙们，就在地狱里为你们的软弱哭泣吧。";
"哈哈哈哈……就凭这点力量也敢踏入这里？";
"现在才跪地求饶也没用了吧？呵呵呵。"

translation:
"You stupid guys, just cry in hell for your weakness.";
"Hahahaha... How dare you step here with this little strength?";
"It's useless to kneel down and beg for mercy now, right? Hahaha."

source_zh:
"到底是谁啊……外面可真吵闹。";
"看来有些没尝过恐惧滋味的小老鼠偷偷闯进来了。";
"打扰我沉睡的代价比死亡还要严重，记住这一点。";
"稍微忍耐一下吧，很快我就会邀请你们参加这场血之盛宴。";
"哈哈哈哈……就这点事你就脸色发白了吗？";
"啧啧啧……偶尔出现点这样的蠢货，生活才不会无聊嘛。";
"如果现在有词典的话，去查查‘蛮勇’这个词的意思吧。";
"埋藏在埃斯拉尼亚的种族之力，很快就将属于我了。";
"现在就倒下的话，恐怕连见到我的机会都没有吧。";
"如果不能让我更开心一点，那可就麻烦了……"

translation:
"Who is it...it's really noisy outside.";
"It seems that some little mice who have never tasted fear have sneaked in.";
"The cost of disturbing my slumber is worse than death, remember this.";
"Be patient for a while, I will invite you to this blood feast soon.";
"Hahahahaha...does this make you pale?";
"Tsk tsk tsk... If idiots like this appear occasionally, life won't be boring.";
"If you have a dictionary now, look up the meaning of the word 'foolish'.";
"The power of the race buried in Eslania will soon belong to me.";
"If you fall down now, you may not even have a chance to see me.";
"If it doesn't make me happier, it will be troublesome..."

source_zh:
"呃……正好趁我受伤时出手……算你走运，小子。";
"以后可得挑好地方待着。下次见面时，那地方就会成为你的坟墓……";
"我会好好记住你的脸。总有一天我要用棍子穿过你的屁股把你挂起来……"

translation:
"Uh... Just take action when I'm injured... You're lucky, kid.";
"You have to choose a good place to stay in the future. The next time we meet, that place will become your grave...";
"I will remember your face well. One day I will put a stick through your ass and hang you up..."

source_zh:
"竟然栽在这些小叛徒手里。等着瞧，下次可没那么容易。";
"你们曾对我效忠的誓言都是谎言吗？不朽之身终将毁灭你们。";
"不但未能击败巴托里，反而向我挥刀相向……背叛的代价将比死亡更惨重。"

translation:
"We fell into the hands of these little traitors. Just wait and see, it won't be so easy next time.";
"Are your oaths of allegiance to me all lies? The immortal body will eventually destroy you.";
"Not only did he fail to defeat Bathory, he instead swung his sword at me... The price of betrayal will be worse than death."

source_zh:
"向你们惊人的勇气致敬。我会尽量让你们不痛苦地离去。";
"哈哈哈哈，能被串成串的装饰品又多了不少。";
"可爱的家伙们，如果你们还有理智的话，就不会再敢来到这里了吧？"

translation:
"Salute to your amazing courage. I will try to make your death as painless as possible.";
"Hahahaha, there are many more decorations that can be strung together.";
"Lovely guys, if you still have sense, you won't dare to come here again, right?"

